To be short and to the point: why not make blessed scrolls of fire act
somewhat like a Fireball spell, limited to only a 3x3 blast?  Like
Stinking Cloud, but with fire.  Seems like this would be logical and
would add a new and interesting tactic (non-spellcasters could write
?oF for emergency horde control).

I mean, given that a blessed scroll of punishment has no adverse
side-effects, why not make the dreaded Fire scroll just a little less
annoying?

And, on a related note, have cursed scrolls of Stinking Cloud
immediately go off, centered on the player.

Seems like those two changes would balance each other out.

